   "source": [
    "# Missing data checks\n",
    "\n",
    "The following checks are on columns that should not have any missing data. If there are any, checks will fail and these need to be investigated.\n",
    "\n",
    "## Check on all fighters (ignoring historic stats)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 3,
   "id": "02cc249e-f10b-4094-b883-6420bd5484e7",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Exclude columns containing these strings because they're expected to have some missing\n",
    "exclude_strings = [\"_round\", \"allround\", \"date_last\", \"hist\"]\n",
    "\n",
    "# Get a list of columns where we expect no missing values\n",
    "columns_no_missing = [col for col in final_data.columns if all(sub not in col for sub in exclude_strings)]\n",
    "\n",
    "# Get a data frame of the counts of missing values\n",
    "missing_counts = pd.DataFrame(final_data[columns_no_missing].isna().sum(axis=0), columns=[\"nan_count\"])"
   ]
  },
